Twist
=====

Copyright (C) 2026 Chris Burdess

Twist is a GNU transfer client.  HTTP/1, HTTP/2, and HTTP/3 are
implemented, and further schemes plug into the same transfer engine.
The command line follows curl for the options, standard streams, and
exit status that the library already supports.

Dependencies
------------

  - quickstep, installed so that pkg-config can see quickstep.pc
  - zlib
  - GNU readline, for the twist program only

Nothing else is added without explicit approval.

Build and install
-----------------

  ./bootstrap
  ./configure
  make
  make check
  make install

If quickstep is installed under a prefix pkg-config does not search,
pass that prefix:

  ./configure --with-quickstep=/prefix

See INSTALL for the GNU build instructions, and DEVELOPMENT.md for
what is finished and what is not.

